&lt;table class=&quot;row module full-width&quot; style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; display: table; border-collapse: collapse; position: relative; border-spacing: 0; background-color: #fefefe;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;small-12 large-12 columns first last&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 20px 10px; width: 650px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 400; vertical-align: top; background-color: #fefefe;&quot;&gt;
&lt;table style=&quot;padding: 0px; width: 100%; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0;&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr style=&quot;padding: 0px; text-align: left; vertical-align: top;&quot;&gt;
 Hello {!$Record.Core_Partner_Account_Id__r.Owner.FirstName},
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 10px; padding: 0px; text-align: left; color: #555554; line-height: 20px; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; border-collapse: collapse !important; -ms-word-break: keep-all; -ms-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; -webkit-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;&quot;&gt;  
The following Deal Registration has been &lt;b&gt;Rejected.&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Registration Number: &lt;/b&gt;{!$Record.Name} 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Deal Registration Name: &lt;/b&gt;{!$Record.Core_Design_Registration_Nm__c}
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;External ID: &lt;/b&gt;{!$Record.PCC_Partner_Reference_ID__c}
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;End Customer Account: &lt;/b&gt;{!$Record.Core_End_Customer_Account_Id__r.Name}  
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Rejection Reason: &lt;/b&gt;{!$Record.Core_Rejection_Reason_Nm__c} 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Rejection Comments: &lt;/b&gt;{!$Record.Core_Rejection_Comment_Txt__c} 
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
{!tabledeal}
&lt;br&gt;
For more details, you can access the deal registration record &lt;a href={!get_internal_record_link.Value__c}{!$Record.Id}&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.
&lt;br&gt;
This email was sent from an unmonitored mailbox. For questions,please contact your Intel Partner Sales Account Manager.
&lt;/p&gt;
